{{Quote|A legendary katana with the power of the skies and their stars.|Item}}
'''Tushita''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Tushita provides great damage with fast moves and little to no endlag on both of its moves. However, it is a very difficult sword to get, especially in public servers. It also has smaller hitboxes compared to other late-game [[swords]] and has less combo potential. 

==Obtainment==
Tushita can be obtained by completing the [[Tushita/Puzzle|Tushita puzzle]].

Upon equipping Tushita, the user will be given the "{{Title|Celestial Swordsman|outline=1}}" [[title]].

==Usage==
Getting both Tushita and [[Yama]] to 350 mastery and being Lv. 2200 or higher will grant the player access to the [[Cursed Dual Katana/Puzzle|Cursed Dual Katana puzzle]] and allow them obtain [[Cursed Dual Katana]] once they have completed the puzzle.

