==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Great combo potential.
* Pretty easy to hit the attacks even without a stun.
* Good grinding capabilities.
* Fast attacks with high damage, making it a great sword in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] and [[Raids]]. 
* Higher damage than [[Yama]].

|'''[Z] Heavenly Lunges'''
* [[Instinct/Break|Breaks Instinct]] upon landing the final, large hit.
* Long stun if not dodged.
* Large [[AoE]].
* Very high damage.

|'''[X] Celestial Ravager'''
* Good range.
* Great mobility.
* High knockback.
* Breaks [[Instinct]] upon direct hit at close range.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Difficult to obtain.
* Cannot hit [[Blade]] users.
* Dashes on the fourth click, making it harder to grind with.
* All moves can be dodged.
* Weak at long range.
* Both moves can be difficult to properly extend off of.

|'''[Z] Heavenly Lunges'''
* Can be exploited if the user holds it for too long, making their opponent able to land attacks if they are not careful.
* If the initial hits are dodged, the enemy is not stunned by the following barrage of hits.

|'''[X] Celestial Ravager'''
* High knockback.
* Hard to aim the second set of slashes, heavily fluctuating the damage.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* Tushita is named after Tusita, one of the six deva-worlds of the Desire Realm in {{w|Buddhism}}.
* "Tushita" cannot be said in Roblox chat. This is due to it having a swear word in it. This means that the player has to say an alternative such as "Tusita" or "Tushi ta".
* There is a glitch where if the user uses the {{Ability|Tushita|Z}} move a split second after unequipping Tushita, they will be stuck in an infinite loop of animation where their arm keeps lunging. The user can not move while doing this and the only way to stop is by resetting.
* Because of [[Yama]]'s recent nerf, people are now choosing Tushita in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] due to [[Instinct|Instinct breaking]] moves, such as '''[X] Celestial Ravager''' breaking it no matter what.
* Both [[Yama]] and Tushita share the exact same upgrade requirements.

